{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And this they begin to do.</b> The heh has a patach vowel." "<b>And now nothing will be withheld, and now.</b> Since all of them know seventy languages — were they to stand in one place, <b>nothing would be withheld from them</b> etc. — they would do all their desire. And if so, what is 'Come, let us descend and confound' — and only then would it be withheld?"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The lemma is vocalized with munach under the heh in some traditions; the comment notes a Masoretic point on the letter."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:50.820260229Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}